{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s tag, but with birds, worms and total mayhem\u2014welcome to Pecking Order! Play as a crafty worm trying to escape, or a hungry bird on the hunt\u2014then drop your catch off to feed your ever-hungry chicks. It\u2019s chaotic, it\u2019s crazy, and it\u2019s a total blast for up to 12 players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/446670c5c2421ae7248c0f530f7f4ab0.webp?t=1756892126\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/446670c5c2421ae7248c0f530f7f4ab0.poster.avif?t=1756892126\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=348 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evade and escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge, weave and pull off strategic maneuvers to outsmart your feathery foes across elaborate, wild environments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/f13e898eb67bd4d5269d209f4ab29890.webp?t=1756892126\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/f13e898eb67bd4d5269d209f4ab29890.poster.avif?t=1756892126\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=348 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death is not the end!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snatched up and fed to a nest of screaming chicks? Tragic. But fear not\u2014death is just the beginning. You\u2019ll rise again, beak first, as a bird with a grudge and a hunger for revenge.\u00a0Welcome to the hunt!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/83afefddc6f60d75ceaa5bb1e8a5966d.webp?t=1756892126\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/83afefddc6f60d75ceaa5bb1e8a5966d.poster.avif?t=1756892126\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=348 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boosts and Powerups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab powerups scattered across the map to take down your foes or protect yourself. Teleport through wormholes, catch updrafts, and use the interactive environment to stay one step ahead of the chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/791acfb0ad85ea19a7efaafd945cf953.webp?t=1756892126\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/791acfb0ad85ea19a7efaafd945cf953.poster.avif?t=1756892126\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=348 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Marvelous Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a selection of bizarre, action-packed maps, each full of perches and clever hiding spots to help you outlast the madness and claim the top spot in the Pecking Order!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/e83f2d9d6120165ad11fa7e30504291d.webp?t=1756892126\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/e83f2d9d6120165ad11fa7e30504291d.poster.avif?t=1756892126\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=348 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun